{"id":789,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Cosmog is very curious but not very cautious, often placing itself in danger. If things start to look dicey, it teleports away."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon came from another universe. Its gaseous body is so light that even a gentle breeze can blow it away."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Whether or not it’s a Pokémon from this world is a mystery. When it’s in a jam, it warps away to a safe place to hide."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Even though its helpless, gaseous body can be blown away by the slightest breeze, it doesn’t seem to care."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"In ages past, it was called the child of the stars. It’s said to be a Pokémon from another world, but no specific details are known."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its body is gaseous and frail. It slowly grows as it collects dust from the atmosphere."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Unaware","hidden":false,"description":"When attacking, the Pokémon ignores the target's stat changes."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":789,"name":"Cosmog","condition":null,"children":[{"id":790,"name":"Cosmoem","condition":"Lv. 43","children":[{"id":791,"name":"Solgaleo","condition":"Lv. 53","children":[]},{"id":792,"name":"Lunala","condition":"Lv. 53","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,100],[1,150]],"machine":[],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-78","name":"Cosmog","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"78","artist":"Mina Nakai","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-78/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-78/large"},{"id":"cel25-13","name":"Cosmog","set":"Celebrations","date":"2021-10-08","rarity":"Rare","number":"13","artist":"kirisAki","img":"cel25/13"},{"id":"sm12-99","name":"Cosmog","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity